# 🔴 MANDATORY FIRST STEP: TOTAL RECALL CLI & TASK ROUTING

1. RUN TOTAL RECALL CLI HELP FIRST:
`total-recall --help`
(or in a source checkout: `node bin/total-recall.mjs --help`)
